window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Ava lived her life on a spaceship in the stars. Now, she is a lone human in a world of others on Planet Xai.</b></p> <p>Despite the love around her, Ava is finding her heart is not as easily soothed. She still has questions about her past, and humanity, that remain unanswered.</p> <p>What does it mean to truly live? For someone who never had a chance to before?</p> <p>Ava Stargazer <i>is a direct sequel to</i> Ava Greasemonkey. <i>It is not a standalone. The Planet Xai series is an alien romance with a big plot, deep emotions, and love in all its forms.</i></p> <p><i>Contains mature content. A complete list of content warnings can be found on the author's website.</i></p>"; 
